Package: onepagr
Title: Accessible One-Page Reports from Typst Templates
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Andrew", "Farrey", email = "afarrey11@outlook.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = "University of Kentucky / KIPRC")
Description: Generates polished, WCAG 2.2 AA and PDF/UA-1 accessible
    one-page (front-and-back) PDF reports from analysis output, using a
    small set of fixed Typst report templates and a swappable design-token
    theme system. Ships built-in report templates and themes, and lets a
    consuming project supply its own design tokens and Typst templates.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    quarto,
    scales,
    tools,
    utils,
    whisker
Suggests:
